			dependencies: ["7B3C010300010000"]
			description: [
				"A small portable inventory that keeps its contents when you"
				"break it, stitched from the same flax as your rope."
				""
				"Early on it is the shulker box you can actually afford. Carry"
				"one on mining trips and walk home with double the loot."
			]
